Cell["\<\
  Independent time batches run on up to ParallelKernels subkernels. Each \
batch includes its preceding sample so finite-step RHP values remain correct \
at batch boundaries. BLP accumulation is performed once, in time order, on \
the master. Engines are sent once per participating kernel; raw full-chain \
trajectories are not returned. Memory estimates include engine copies and \
batch work arrays, but are estimates rather than a hard operating-system \
memory limit.  \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7975483a-834b-b24d-b00b-9f7f8e7f6cd8"],

