Cell["\<\
  Interpretation: the transverse fields are not dephasing fields on the \
probes. ZZ probes still have a Schur channel and rank at most four; Exchange \
need not be unital or U(1)-covariant. Covariance plots measure deviations and \
are not symmetry constraints asserted by this workflow. Choi negativity \
refers to reference-versus-output entanglement, not entanglement between A \
and B. The plotted State Concurrence is edge-edge entanglement. The ZZ \
EntanglingConcurrence is the exact maximum over separable edge inputs for \
this fixed bulk, not an optimization over bulk states. No infinite-time \
average is computed.  \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"28db89e9-a98d-384e-b6fd-a7779ee034dc"]
}, Closed]],

